---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Let `ssh NAME.sbx` reach a sandbox (adds a managed block to ~/.ssh/config)

Usage: bento setup ssh [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  remove  Remove the managed block from ~/.ssh/config [alias: rm]
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --auto-create
          Add connections for desktop apps (not supported)

  -D, --debug
          Enable debug logging: each smolvm call, and SMOLBENTO_LOG at info unless set

      --no-input
          Never prompt; commands that need an answer fail with the command to run instead

  -h, --help
          Print help
